This network is centered on making EV_battery units, with Assembly Hub handling production and Regional Depot serving as the warehouse in the same supplier-facility structure that links SiliconWorks, Process Go., and Memory Star. Each EV_battery requires 4 units of lithium_cell and 1 unit of ceramic_substrate. Lithium_cell supply is sourced on demand, while ceramic_substrate follows a min-max style replenishment rule: when stock drops below 3478.27 units, it is brought back up to 3775.65 units. For ceramic_substrate, the shortage penalty is $17.317 per unit, and inventory is reviewed every 9 weeks. Finished EV_battery stock starts at 2042611 units, carries a holding cost of $2.277 per unit, faces a shortage cost of $23.28 per unit, and is reviewed every 1 week. On the supply side, SiliconWorks provides lithium_cell with a fixed supplier lead time of 15.0 weeks at $254.421 per unit, and payment is made between 27.0 weeks and 36.0 weeks after delivery; once shipped, the transfer to Assembly Hub takes 1.0 week. Process Go. supplies ceramic_substrate at $128.579 per unit, with lead time fixed between 15.0 weeks and 15.0 weeks, and payment due exactly 38.0 days after receipt. Memory Star is the second lithium_cell source, offering it at $160.489 per unit with a consistent 9.0-week lead time and net 53.0 days payment terms; movement from Memory Star to Assembly Hub takes between 1.0 weeks and 12.0 weeks. At Assembly Hub, the polishing operation converts lithium_cell and ceramic_substrate into EV_battery, and each production cycle runs anywhere from 4.0 weeks to 10.0 weeks. Customer demand comes from Samsung Electronics, with order arrivals ranging from 17.0 weeks to 45.0 weeks, and each order size falls between 480236.0 units and 3521771.0 units. Delivery to the customer takes 13.0 to 20.0 weeks, the selling price is $3945.242 per unit, and customer payments are received between 36.0 days and 79.0 days later. If EV_battery is unavailable, the sale is lost rather than backordered. The model runs for a horizon of 730 weeks with 1 replication.

