s at 2291515 units, is reviewed every 1 day, and incurs a holding cost of $8.94 per unit. On the demand side, Samsung Electronics places drone orders exactly every 18.0 days, with order volume ranging from 106471.0 units to 1959738.0 units. Those shipments are expected in 3.0 days to 8.0 days, sold at $3205.472 per unit, and paid 48.0 days later; if inventory runs short, available units are shipped and the remainder is lost. Apple Supply orders more intermittently, with arrivals averaging 34.0 days, but each order is a fixed 2321422.0 units. Its delivery expectation ranges from 3.0 days to 25.0 days, the selling price is $4366.084 per unit, and payment comes 68.0 days after delivery; if stock is unavailable, the sale is simply lost. The model runs over a 500-day horizon with 10 replications.

