18.0 units, and promised delivery to the customer falls in a 15.0 to 22.0 hour range. The sales approach is partial fulfillment with lost remainder, so available units are shipped and any shortfall is lost rather than backordered. The product sells at $4915.624 per unit, and Sony Electronics pays on a constant 76.0-hour term. The model runs over a 100-hour horizon, with the first 50 hours treated as warm-up, and it is repeated 5 times.

